---
---

<header id="hero">
	<div class="kicker">Cornell ECE 5760 · Final Project · Spring 2026</div>
	<h1>Real-Time Stereo Vision on the DE1-SoC</h1>
	<p class="soundbite">
		Two cheap cameras, one Cyclone V FPGA, and a real-time depth map streamed straight to a VGA
		screen.
	</p>
	<div class="byline">
		<span>Daniel</span>
		<span class="sep">·</span>
		<span>Demetrios</span>
		<span class="sep">·</span>
		<span>Ezra</span>
	</div>
	<div class="chips">
		<span class="chip">Terasic DE1-SoC</span>
		<span class="chip">Cyclone V FPGA</span>
		<span class="chip">SystemVerilog</span>
		<span class="chip">ARM HPS / C</span>
		<span class="chip">Python golden model</span>
		<span class="chip accent">SAD + 1D SGM @ 20 FPS</span>
	</div>
</header>

<style>
	#hero {
		padding: 80px 0 56px;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
		margin-bottom: 56px;
	}

	.kicker {
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		color: var(--accent-hot);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.18em;
		font-weight: 600;
		margin-bottom: 18px;
	}

	#hero h1 {
		margin: 0 0 0.35em;
		max-width: 18ch;
	}

	.soundbite {
		font-family: 'Source Serif 4', serif;
		font-size: 1.35rem;
		font-style: italic;
		color: var(--text-dim);
		max-width: 60ch;
		margin: 0 0 1.5em;
		line-height: 1.4;
	}

	.byline {
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		color: var(--text-dim);
		margin-bottom: 1.5em;
	}

	.sep {
		margin: 0 0.4em;
		color: var(--text-muted);
	}

	.chips {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 8px;
	}

	.chip {
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		padding: 5px 12px;
		background: var(--bg-card);
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
		border-radius: 999px;
		color: var(--text-dim);
		font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
	}

	.chip.accent {
		background: var(--accent-soft);
		border-color: var(--accent);
		color: #ffd6d6;
	}
</style>
